<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  MasterClock — pt-BR (Brazilian Portuguese)

  An override, not a translation. Android resolves pt-BR as values-pt-rBR, then values-pt, then the
  English default, string by string — so this file carries only the words where Brazilian and
  European Portuguese actually part company, and everything else comes from values-pt.

  The recurring pairs are tela/ecrã, configurações/definições, compartilhar/partilhar,
  arquivo/ficheiro, salvar/guardar, excluir/eliminar, pressionar/premir, rodada/ronda, and the
  -ônico spellings against -ónico. A string not listed here is shared vocabulary: "lance",
  "bandeirinha", "relógio" and the rest read the same on both sides of the Atlantic.
-->
